                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dbee390e-31d7-3549-ad5e-e43e421045a9",
                        "entry_id": "5f3edc29-ecb0-3e2e-bb80-30b9181526ec",
                        "glosses": [
                            "специалист по автомобильному делу"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0afd5de-fed5-45ef-8767-69f43668b94b",
                                "sense_id": "dbee390e-31d7-3549-ad5e-e43e421045a9",
                                "text": "Впрочем, Максим Медведков сказал, что если до 10 марта автомобилисты представят подробное обоснование, каким образом они сделают через 10 лет автомобили будущего, то правительство может своё решение и пересмотреть."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "37e501c6-06ae-3a9d-96d9-f35850741a97",
                        "entry_id": "5f3edc29-ecb0-3e2e-bb80-30b9181526ec",
                        "glosses": [
                            "водитель или владелец автомобиля"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "079fbb8b-c5ac-420c-a4c7-e7a47309045f",
                                "sense_id": "37e501c6-06ae-3a9d-96d9-f35850741a97",
                                "text": "Вообразим грустную для автомобилиста ситуацию: надо уехать надолго, а последить за машиной некому."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9c69e7c6-2120-3abf-996a-4b0a4d691dea",
                        "entry_id": "5f3edc29-ecb0-3e2e-bb80-30b9181526ec",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спортсмен, занимающийся автомобильным спортом"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b19c4a62-fb8c-4c74-a63c-915aa9144ce1",
                                "sense_id": "9c69e7c6-2120-3abf-996a-4b0a4d691dea",
                                "text": "Первым из 78 участников пробега прибыл в Монако русский автомобилист А. П. Нагель на машине русского производства, постройки Русско-Балтийского завода."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2fa25559-73d8-4d90-91b3-a678286fc36e",
                        "source_entry_id": "5f3edc29-ecb0-3e2e-bb80-30b9181526ec",
                        "target_lang_word": "motorist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "motorist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4466876-3cc9-3a3a-af6b-df48569c54f9",
                                        "entry_id": "84613f6b-a468-394d-99c7-131348d3fbd4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who drives a motor vehicle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9dbaeb5-e30f-45e1-aa05-153dda30c529",
                                                "sense_id": "b4466876-3cc9-3a3a-af6b-df48569c54f9",
                                                "text": "Moreover, the motorist, even if the speed at which he travelled enabled him to appreciate what he saw, does not see the country at all. What he does see is a tarred road, a couple of blackened or dust-covered hedges, and a stream of other motorists."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f2e2e6c-f936-4ad8-9ed2-fb77f7446d23",
                                                "sense_id": "b4466876-3cc9-3a3a-af6b-df48569c54f9",
                                                "text": "In a poll released last week, the AAA Foundation for Traffic Safety found that 58 percent of drivers consider other motorists talking on a cellphone to be a very serious threat and that 87 percent consider motorists e-mailing or texting to be such a threat."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7c2eec7d-28e9-4d2c-a4e3-6a21ed95e2eb",
                        "source_entry_id": "5f3edc29-ecb0-3e2e-bb80-30b9181526ec",
                        "target_lang_word": "automobilista",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "automobilista",
                                "target_lang_code": "it",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc929f7d-aee5-3e5b-a7ee-963817dfc40e",
                                        "entry_id": "5645218e-1efb-39af-996b-5b336e1226ce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "chi guida un'automobile"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "060b724e-c200-4ccc-a8ce-b3652130fadc",
                        "source_entry_id": "5f3edc29-ecb0-3e2e-bb80-30b9181526ec",
                        "target_lang_word": "Automobilist",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Automobilist",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f65b475d-1de4-3990-91a3-6682e7938c15",
                                        "entry_id": "a8429aeb-d5c7-36ad-8225-73c16d1875a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die ein Auto fährt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "regional (Schweiz und Luxemburg)",
                                            "Verkehr"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6393306-8bfa-4f17-b8ec-b0633a2c724f",
                                                "sense_id": "f65b475d-1de4-3990-91a3-6682e7938c15",
                                                "text": "„Ein rücksichtsloser junger Automobilist aus dem Thurgau hat am frühen Freitagabend auf der A 3 zwei Unfälle und auf der A 53 einen Verkehrsunfall verursacht.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8d95475-ffa3-47d0-b8c4-ed6a084ec1ef",
                                                "sense_id": "f65b475d-1de4-3990-91a3-6682e7938c15",
                                                "text": "„Ich bin sowohl Automobilist als auch Fußgänger und entschlossen, mich genau an die Höchstgeschwindigkeit von 50 Stundenkilometern zu halten.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8d076bde-80fc-45ae-a334-02d604d9a697",
                        "source_entry_id": "5f3edc29-ecb0-3e2e-bb80-30b9181526ec",
                        "target_lang_word": "Autofahrer",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Autofahrer",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf7ee4d0-3887-3c8a-afae-8e49938bba27",
                                        "entry_id": "aabcf415-26b0-360b-9ae8-fee807b6fc75",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "jemand, der ein Auto lenkt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c1d0f2f-0bc5-4a4e-9548-466579c9f1b3",
                                                "sense_id": "cf7ee4d0-3887-3c8a-afae-8e49938bba27",
                                                "text": "„Der erfahrene Pilot besteigt sein Segelflugzeug mit nicht mehr Angst als der Autofahrer sein Auto.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "219a8e37-7687-4a57-a26a-a39769019189",
                                                "sense_id": "cf7ee4d0-3887-3c8a-afae-8e49938bba27",
                                                "text": "Viele Autofahrer halten nicht an Stoppschildern."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb0dca66-fc88-4e90-b9a9-bd5386359694",
                                                "sense_id": "cf7ee4d0-3887-3c8a-afae-8e49938bba27",
                                                "text": "„Durch Reform der Verkehrssünderkartei verlieren 141 000 Autofahrer ihre Punkte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1b75635-b90a-4707-ac71-3e09be2f281d",
                                                "sense_id": "cf7ee4d0-3887-3c8a-afae-8e49938bba27",
                                                "text": "„Michael zeigte mir, wie man Autofahrern einen Streich spielen konnte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9989ee02-83ec-4a81-bada-051ff6b269f3",
                                                "sense_id": "cf7ee4d0-3887-3c8a-afae-8e49938bba27",
                                                "text": "„Sollte die spanische Costa del Sol irgendeinen Nutzen haben, dann für Autofahrer, denn die Infrastruktur an der Sonnenküste ist denkbar gut ausgebaut.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "649b97e2-3f12-4572-9d0f-34b44f141775",
                        "source_entry_id": "5f3edc29-ecb0-3e2e-bb80-30b9181526ec",
